One note: `GivenPosts` saves on every call, so each `GivenPost` followed by the aggregate save keeps persistence simple — each test calls `GivenPost` several times then `GivenPosts(posts)` once, which saves all pending entities. If a test adds posts after `GivenPosts`, it won't be saved; adjust call ordering if needed.

