Concern: `SumAsync` on empty Posts — EF Core SumAsync returns 0 for int (SUM over empty set returns null in SQL, but EF Core translates Sum to handle null → returns 0 for non-nullable int). Yes, EF Core SumAsync on int returns 0 for empty set. Safe.

Post.BlogId is required int? `required string Title` — Title required, Views int default, BlogId int — we set via navigation, fine.

